# Virial / pressure test — compare pressure against ASE reference
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. Generate reference: python reference_pressure.py
#
# Run:
#   mpirun -np 1 lmp_gpu -in test_virial.lammps
#
# Pass criteria: LAMMPS press matches ASE pressure to within 1%.

units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p

read_data       reference_structure.data
mass            1 63.546

pair_style      zero 6.0
pair_coeff      * *

fix             mlip all rootstock cluster della model mace checkpoint medium device cpu elements Cu

thermo_style    custom step press
thermo          1

run             0

print "VIRIAL TEST COMPLETE — compare press against ASE reference"
